<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Communications started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Communications started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Tuesday it had started coverage of 360 Communications Co with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were unchanged at 23-1/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
